      "id": "title_sub",
      "x": 93,
      "y": 94,
      "width": 1603.125,
      "height": 22.5,
      "text": "Prove the state space before any data exists. Generate from it. Reconcile deterministically. Surface it. Then grade the engine against that same oracle.",
